{"4934020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wurst and Glory", "steam_appid": 4934020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/e1dc2cca15e264a783d692ae35d59e5d.avif?t=1786542658\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras_big/e1dc2cca15e264a783d692ae35d59e5d.avif?t=1786542658 width=1560 height=536 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into the arena as royalty and settle disputes the only way tradition allows: SAUSAGE COMBAT. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wurst and Glory is the premier competitive dueling simulator for the noble athlete. Every duel, you're offered 3 random sausages to wield. Pick one you've never used before, and it joins your arsenal. Fight against other players and learn to understand and deal with the different sausage types and their quirks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/526ad486a5b366f982264d15dfb90315.poster.avif?t=1786542658\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/526ad486a5b366f982264d15dfb90315.webm?t=1786542658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/526ad486a5b366f982264d15dfb90315.mp4?t=1786542658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master</strong> the physics of floppy meat combat, <strong>learn</strong> which sausage counters which, and <strong>collect</strong> every wobbly weapon in the arsenal.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/ed6da4dca2d42cc2c2543b873335dd1a.poster.avif?t=1786542658\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/ed6da4dca2d42cc2c2543b873335dd1a.webm?t=1786542658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/ed6da4dca2d42cc2c2543b873335dd1a.mp4?t=1786542658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become</strong> the master of the banqueting hall: throw tomatoes at your opponent to blind their view, or use a pretzel as a shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/9abdf5a21d67ac61d88881265f7b5f40.poster.avif?t=1786542658\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/9abdf5a21d67ac61d88881265f7b5f40.webm?t=1786542658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/9abdf5a21d67ac61d88881265f7b5f40.mp4?t=1786542658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No skill trees. No pay to win.  Just you, a rival noble, and whatever cured meat fate hands you this round.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Duel for honor. Duel for glory. Duel with sausages.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/ec9ef6f45d3814cf5936a1d8bacbb23d.avif?t=1786542658\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/1436592ed1a0e7116898d55bf1ed2664.avif?t=1786542658\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/f38949dd603df865126e0f36e3103787.avif?t=1786542658\" width=128 height=128 /></span><strong> </strong> <br>  <br>  <br>  <br>  <br>  <br>  </h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/e1dc2cca15e264a783d692ae35d59e5d.avif?t=1786542658\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras_big/e1dc2cca15e264a783d692ae35d59e5d.avif?t=1786542658 width=1560 height=536 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into the arena as royalty and settle disputes the only way tradition allows: SAUSAGE COMBAT. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wurst and Glory is the premier competitive dueling simulator for the noble athlete. Every duel, you're offered 3 random sausages to wield. Pick one you've never used before, and it joins your arsenal. Fight against other players and learn to understand and deal with the different sausage types and their quirks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/526ad486a5b366f982264d15dfb90315.poster.avif?t=1786542658\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/526ad486a5b366f982264d15dfb90315.webm?t=1786542658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/526ad486a5b366f982264d15dfb90315.mp4?t=1786542658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master</strong> the physics of floppy meat combat, <strong>learn</strong> which sausage counters which, and <strong>collect</strong> every wobbly weapon in the arsenal.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/ed6da4dca2d42cc2c2543b873335dd1a.poster.avif?t=1786542658\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/ed6da4dca2d42cc2c2543b873335dd1a.webm?t=1786542658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/ed6da4dca2d42cc2c2543b873335dd1a.mp4?t=1786542658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become</strong> the master of the banqueting hall: throw tomatoes at your opponent to blind their view, or use a pretzel as a shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/9abdf5a21d67ac61d88881265f7b5f40.poster.avif?t=1786542658\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/9abdf5a21d67ac61d88881265f7b5f40.webm?t=1786542658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/9abdf5a21d67ac61d88881265f7b5f40.mp4?t=1786542658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No skill trees. No pay to win.  Just you, a rival noble, and whatever cured meat fate hands you this round.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Duel for honor. Duel for glory. Duel with sausages.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/ec9ef6f45d3814cf5936a1d8bacbb23d.avif?t=1786542658\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/1436592ed1a0e7116898d55bf1ed2664.avif?t=1786542658\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/extras/f38949dd603df865126e0f36e3103787.avif?t=1786542658\" width=128 height=128 /></span><strong> </strong> <br>  <br>  <br>  <br>  <br>  <br>  </h2>", "short_description": "Wurst and Glory is a competitive dueling game for noble athletes. Settle royal disputes through SAUSAGE COMBAT. Every duel offers 3 random sausages—pick one new to add to your arsenal. Master floppy meat physics, counter foes, and duel for honor, glory, and sausages.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/e4bf4fdb219ec449a81c374a66f470426f4b83c7/header.jpg?t=1786542658", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/13b6acd7d50c803ed56463c16b0bcb49b62a9e09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786542658", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4934020/13b6acd7d50c803ed56463c16b0bcb49b62a9e09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786542658", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-7700 / AMD Ryzen 7 1700X or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR or OpenXR<br></li><li><strong>Additiona